1
00:00:23,744 --> 00:00:28,483
♪Looking in the mirror,
my temples have turned white♪

2
00:00:28,483 --> 00:00:32,195
♪Taking off the hairpins and makeup,
shedding the disguise♪

3
00:00:32,419 --> 00:00:34,664
♪A cold face♪

4
00:00:35,011 --> 00:00:37,718
♪With two lines of tears♪

5
00:00:38,597 --> 00:00:43,125
♪If an actor could gain pity♪

6
00:00:43,125 --> 00:00:46,757
♪The audience offers sincere words♪

7
00:00:47,235 --> 00:00:50,723
♪Perhaps the story could be changed♪

8
00:00:52,867 --> 00:00:55,363
♪The storyteller says♪

9
00:00:55,363 --> 00:01:00,003
♪This mortal world is full of turmoil♪

10
00:01:00,391 --> 00:01:02,051
♪Within sight but beyond reach♪

11
00:01:02,051 --> 00:01:08,003
♪Yet I still don't want to give up♪

12
00:01:08,195 --> 00:01:11,883
♪Don't let the memory be hollowed out♪

13
00:01:11,883 --> 00:01:15,454
♪Don't make me ridiculous♪

14
00:01:15,619 --> 00:01:22,563
♪Some vows turn into smoke
and fade away♪

15
00:01:23,011 --> 00:01:26,632
♪Even the leaves know when autumn comes,
but you don't even know me♪

16
00:01:26,632 --> 00:01:30,316
♪Imprisoned in plight,
yet still full of passion♪

17
00:01:30,403 --> 00:01:35,331
♪I mock this absurd and entangled love♪

18
00:01:35,331 --> 00:01:39,491
♪How can I bear to let go♪

19
00:01:43,235 --> 00:01:46,787
=Whispers of Southern Song=

20
00:01:47,331 --> 00:01:49,987
=Episode 24=

21
00:01:58,319 --> 00:02:01,719
Xu You'an, my good son.

22
00:02:02,840 --> 00:02:04,920
You can't run away this time.

23
00:02:10,719 --> 00:02:11,840
Where is the treasure map?

24
00:02:16,560 --> 00:02:17,719
Right here.

25
00:02:19,039 --> 00:02:20,680
See if you have what it takes to get it.

26
00:02:29,879 --> 00:02:31,800
If you hand over the treasure map,

27
00:02:32,360 --> 00:02:33,680
kneel, and beg for mercy,

28
00:02:34,159 --> 00:02:36,520
for the sake of our many years of bond,

29
00:02:37,560 --> 00:02:40,199
I will grant you a decent death.

30
00:02:42,479 --> 00:02:43,840
Then for the rest of your life,

31
00:02:46,319 --> 00:02:48,680
don't even think about
finding that treasure map.

32
00:02:49,919 --> 00:02:50,719
Wait.

33
00:02:51,960 --> 00:02:53,759
We can't let him off so easily.

34
00:02:54,439 --> 00:02:57,479
I want to watch him die slowly.

35
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:09,800
You go first.

36
00:03:09,879 --> 00:03:10,759
I'll cover the rear.

37
00:03:10,840 --> 00:03:12,319
Or neither of us will survive.

38
00:03:12,400 --> 00:03:13,199
Xu You'an,

39
00:03:13,919 --> 00:03:15,400
we promised to live and die together.

40
00:03:15,759 --> 00:03:17,080
If you die alone,

41
00:03:17,400 --> 00:03:18,719
you'll break your promise again.

42
00:03:19,879 --> 00:03:22,199
Do you want me to live in guilt
for the rest of my life?

43
00:03:24,512 --> 00:03:26,400
♪Helpless situations♪

44
00:03:26,400 --> 00:03:29,024
♪Overwhelmed by time♪

45
00:03:30,155 --> 00:03:32,115
♪Even if I have questions♪

46
00:03:32,115 --> 00:03:34,000
♪I harbor desires♪

47
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:36,199
Alright, you take the Buddha Head

48
00:03:36,639 --> 00:03:38,319
and go to the meeting place
with Chun'er.

49
00:03:38,800 --> 00:03:42,159
I promise you
we'll all live on well together.

50
00:03:42,159 --> 00:03:44,520
♪Wandering around♪

51
00:03:44,768 --> 00:03:47,680
♪Fortunate to have you with me♪

52
00:03:47,680 --> 00:03:52,082
♪Go through the entanglement♪

53
00:03:52,448 --> 00:03:54,176
♪If longing♪

54
00:03:54,176 --> 00:03:57,335
♪Turns into dust and smoke♪

55
00:03:57,335 --> 00:04:00,090
♪How can I be at ease♪

56
00:04:00,192 --> 00:04:02,506
♪Having walked through prosperous times♪

57
00:04:02,624 --> 00:04:04,480
♪And travelled around the world♪

58
00:04:04,576 --> 00:04:07,664
♪Scars all over me♪

59
00:04:07,840 --> 00:04:10,848
♪If longing never fades♪

60
00:04:10,848 --> 00:04:12,297
♪Burns still hot♪

61
00:04:13,840 --> 00:04:14,639
Xu You'an.

62
00:04:15,648 --> 00:04:17,505
♪After half a lifetime of loneliness♪

63
00:04:17,568 --> 00:04:18,752
♪In the next life♪

64
00:04:18,752 --> 00:04:23,232
♪Entangle with you again♪

65
00:04:23,520 --> 00:04:25,248
♪If longing♪

66
00:04:25,248 --> 00:04:28,407
♪Turns into dust and smoke♪

67
00:04:28,407 --> 00:04:31,162
♪How can I be at ease♪

68
00:04:31,264 --> 00:04:33,578
♪Having walked through prosperous times♪

69
00:04:33,696 --> 00:04:35,552
♪And travelled around the world♪

70
00:04:35,648 --> 00:04:38,736
♪Scars all over me♪

71
00:04:38,912 --> 00:04:41,920
♪If longing never fades♪

72
00:04:41,920 --> 00:04:43,369
♪Burns still hot♪

73
00:04:43,369 --> 00:04:49,792
♪Let it turn into dust and smoke♪

74
00:04:50,279 --> 00:04:53,839
(Rong Xiaonan, you must
make it out alive.)

75
00:05:03,160 --> 00:05:03,959
Xu You'an,

76
00:05:05,120 --> 00:05:06,480
stop trying to act tough.

77
00:05:07,399 --> 00:05:08,759
Hand over the treasure map,

78
00:05:09,639 --> 00:05:10,800
and you may still live on.

79
00:05:11,480 --> 00:05:14,480
Or I'll kill you immediately.

80
00:05:24,560 --> 00:05:26,279
When father and son talk,

81
00:05:27,480 --> 00:05:30,879
outsiders have no place
to interrupt. Right?

82
00:05:36,279 --> 00:05:37,079
My son,

83
00:05:38,680 --> 00:05:40,759
now it's just you and me.

84
00:05:41,879 --> 00:05:43,240
You can tell me now, right?

85
00:05:47,639 --> 00:05:49,480
You actually killed him?

86
00:05:50,360 --> 00:05:52,199
What about your deal?

87
00:05:54,079 --> 00:05:55,360
He was nothing at all.

88
00:05:56,040 --> 00:05:58,199
I've long wanted to kill him.

89
00:05:58,519 --> 00:05:59,872
Without him,

90
00:05:59,872 --> 00:06:02,800
I can trade with the Japanese directly

91
00:06:02,800 --> 00:06:04,240
and get much more.

92
00:06:04,279 --> 00:06:08,560
As for you, hand over
the treasure map obediently.

93
00:06:09,240 --> 00:06:13,720
And I will let you continue
being our family's watchdog.

94
00:06:15,839 --> 00:06:16,639
Speak.

95
00:06:18,399 --> 00:06:20,279
Where is the treasure map?

96
00:06:22,800 --> 00:06:23,600
Speak.

97
00:06:45,160 --> 00:06:48,560
Devils belong in the hell.

98
00:06:49,240 --> 00:06:50,319
I said

99
00:06:52,360 --> 00:06:57,000
that I'll take care of you till the end.

100
00:07:00,360 --> 00:07:02,079
Don't shoot.

101
00:07:12,160 --> 00:07:14,439
Xu You'an! Xu You'an!

102
00:07:31,800 --> 00:07:33,240
(How many orphans)

103
00:07:34,439 --> 00:07:36,199
(in this chaotic world got to live...)

104
00:07:36,399 --> 00:07:37,399
Xu You'an!

105
00:07:37,399 --> 00:07:38,639
(Like I did?)

106
00:07:41,439 --> 00:07:43,279
(I once had a brother too.)

107
00:07:45,079 --> 00:07:46,519
(If he were still alive,)

108
00:07:48,000 --> 00:07:49,839
(he would probably look just like you.)

109
00:07:53,639 --> 00:07:56,319
Let's make this place
our home from now on.

110
00:07:57,280 --> 00:08:04,096
♪Let it turn into dust and smoke♪

111
00:08:04,544 --> 00:08:06,401
♪After half a lifetime of loneliness♪

112
00:08:07,839 --> 00:08:10,959
Brother!

113
00:09:13,240 --> 00:09:14,840
You want me dead?

114
00:09:17,200 --> 00:09:18,919
It's not that easy.

115
00:09:27,639 --> 00:09:30,840
♪Without entering the garden♪

116
00:09:31,559 --> 00:09:46,720
♪How can I know the beauty of spring♪

117
00:09:51,104 --> 00:09:55,843
♪Looking in the mirror,
my temples have turned white♪

118
00:09:55,843 --> 00:09:59,555
♪Taking off the hairpins and makeup,
shedding the disguise♪

119
00:09:59,779 --> 00:10:02,024
♪A cold face♪

120
00:10:02,371 --> 00:10:05,078
♪With two lines of tears♪

121
00:10:06,200 --> 00:10:09,000
(And Chun'er, you'll be our backup.)

122
00:10:09,559 --> 00:10:11,320
(Get there before dawn.)

123
00:10:11,360 --> 00:10:12,840
(If the Jade Buddha Head is there,)

124
00:10:13,519 --> 00:10:15,000
(no matter what happens to us,)

125
00:10:15,360 --> 00:10:17,639
(take the Jade Buddha Head
and leave first.)

126
00:10:20,227 --> 00:10:22,723
♪The storyteller says♪

127
00:10:22,723 --> 00:10:27,363
♪This mortal world is full of turmoil♪

128
00:10:27,751 --> 00:10:29,411
♪Within sight but beyond reach♪

129
00:10:32,720 --> 00:10:41,759
♪Gorgeous purples♪

130
00:10:42,639 --> 00:10:44,360
♪And brilliant reds♪

131
00:10:44,360 --> 00:10:46,639
Still daring to sing opera here?

132
00:10:47,559 --> 00:10:49,039
Now take this.

133
00:10:49,600 --> 00:10:51,080
♪And brilliant reds bloom♪

134
00:10:59,480 --> 00:11:02,600
Speak. Where is the treasure map?

135
00:11:05,840 --> 00:11:14,519
♪It turns out♪

136
00:11:28,159 --> 00:11:31,320
Mr. Rong, you're no longer needed.

137
00:11:52,639 --> 00:11:54,320
How dare you deceive me!

138
00:12:21,024 --> 00:12:25,763
♪Looking in the mirror,
my temples have turned white♪

139
00:12:25,763 --> 00:12:29,475
♪Taking off the hairpins and makeup,
shedding the disguise♪

140
00:12:29,699 --> 00:12:31,944
♪A cold face♪

141
00:12:32,440 --> 00:12:34,039
(Xu You'an,)

142
00:12:34,240 --> 00:12:35,840
(you said,)

143
00:12:36,639 --> 00:12:38,240
(though the ceremony was not completed,)

144
00:12:39,039 --> 00:12:40,639
(we are still family.)

145
00:12:42,080 --> 00:12:43,679
(I remember what you said.)

146
00:12:46,639 --> 00:12:47,919
(Mr. Rong,)

147
00:12:49,480 --> 00:12:51,360
(I'll see the world beyond the stage)

148
00:12:52,320 --> 00:12:53,720
(for you.)

149
00:12:55,519 --> 00:12:58,320
(I will rewrite all those
tedious opera scripts.)

150
00:12:59,360 --> 00:13:02,480
(I'll write a piece of Po Zhen Zi,)

151
00:13:04,200 --> 00:13:06,000
(not about the one
in the boudoir's dream)

152
00:13:06,960 --> 00:13:09,159
(but about the Vermilion Bird
reborn from fire,)

153
00:13:10,320 --> 00:13:14,799
(holding the sun in its beak
and flying into the daylight.)

154
00:13:19,968 --> 00:13:23,240
♪Even the leaves know when autumn comes,
but you don't even know me♪

155
00:13:23,240 --> 00:13:29,039
- Great!
- Great!

156
00:13:41,248 --> 00:13:51,168
♪It turns out♪

157
00:13:51,822 --> 00:13:58,903
♪Gorgeous purples♪

158
00:14:02,656 --> 00:14:14,208
♪And brilliant reds bloom everywhere♪

159
00:14:32,360 --> 00:14:33,159
Everyone's here.

160
00:14:34,440 --> 00:14:35,240
Welcome.

161
00:14:36,799 --> 00:14:40,320
Welcome to our
Dreammaker Murder Mystery Club.

162
00:14:41,559 --> 00:14:45,759
We'll play the script
"Whispers of Southern Song".

163
00:14:45,759 --> 00:14:46,916
(Whispers of Southern Song)

164
00:14:47,519 --> 00:14:50,399
Now, let me introduce
the story background.

165
00:14:51,840 --> 00:14:53,304
During the era of Republic of China,

166
00:14:53,799 --> 00:14:55,039
warlords ruled,

167
00:14:55,759 --> 00:14:58,240
and conspiracies lurked
behind the prosperity.

168
00:15:00,080 --> 00:15:02,360
In this magical age

169
00:15:02,360 --> 00:15:04,440
of interwoven extravagance and gunfire,

170
00:15:04,840 --> 00:15:08,080
heroic tales unfolded in the chaos.

171
00:15:09,720 --> 00:15:11,759
Shitou and Zhuzi

172
00:15:11,919 --> 00:15:13,759
were both orphans wandering the streets.

173
00:15:14,200 --> 00:15:16,799
With similar fates,
they called each other brothers

174
00:15:17,399 --> 00:15:19,919
and clung to each other
in the turbulent times,

175
00:15:20,360 --> 00:15:23,559
living a life of wandering and hardship.

176
00:15:24,352 --> 00:15:29,398
♪Trapped in dawn and dusk♪

177
00:15:29,826 --> 00:15:31,637
♪Candle by the west window♪

178
00:15:31,766 --> 00:15:34,070
♪Burned out this life♪

179
00:15:34,366 --> 00:15:37,128
♪Ending in nothingness♪

180
00:15:37,431 --> 00:15:39,589
♪I ask why♪

181
00:15:39,940 --> 00:15:44,599
♪I yearn for the one who's gone
through heat and cold♪

182
00:15:44,964 --> 00:15:46,628
♪A handful of earth♪

183
00:15:46,820 --> 00:15:49,391
♪The world's last gamble♪

184
00:15:49,572 --> 00:15:52,676
♪Sighing at the late hour♪

185
00:15:54,116 --> 00:15:58,624
♪No one comes to meet me♪

186
00:16:15,360 --> 00:16:16,640
♪As if it were fate♪

187
00:16:16,640 --> 00:16:17,997
♪Deliberately playing tricks♪

188
00:16:18,559 --> 00:16:21,796
♪We miss each other♪

189
00:16:23,040 --> 00:16:24,608
♪Creating a turbulent drama♪

190
00:16:24,608 --> 00:16:27,008
♪And a bizarre♪

191
00:16:27,008 --> 00:16:29,810
♪Anonymous legend♪

192
00:16:30,340 --> 00:16:32,352
♪The plot twists and turns♪

193
00:16:32,500 --> 00:16:34,240
♪Play out over and over again♪

194
00:16:34,240 --> 00:16:37,304
♪Waiting to be discarded♪

195
00:16:37,885 --> 00:16:39,584
♪And you are like a moth to the flame♪

196
00:16:39,584 --> 00:16:40,576
♪Refuse to submit♪

197
00:16:40,576 --> 00:16:43,776
♪I can't bear to blame you♪

198
00:16:45,440 --> 00:16:48,352
♪There are always too many♪

199
00:16:48,352 --> 00:16:50,240
♪Helpless situations♪

200
00:16:50,240 --> 00:16:52,864
♪Overwhelmed by time♪

201
00:16:53,995 --> 00:16:55,955
♪Even if I have questions♪

202
00:16:55,955 --> 00:16:57,955
♪I harbor desires♪

203
00:16:57,955 --> 00:17:00,832
♪Nowhere to find answers♪

204
00:17:01,183 --> 00:17:02,816
♪People come and go♪

205
00:17:02,816 --> 00:17:05,632
♪I'm still all alone♪

206
00:17:05,632 --> 00:17:08,360
♪Wandering around♪

207
00:17:08,608 --> 00:17:11,461
♪Fortunate to have you with me♪

208
00:17:11,461 --> 00:17:15,922
♪Go through the entanglement♪

209
00:17:16,288 --> 00:17:18,016
♪If longing♪

210
00:17:18,016 --> 00:17:21,175
♪Turns into dust and smoke♪

211
00:17:21,175 --> 00:17:23,930
♪How can I be at ease♪

212
00:17:24,032 --> 00:17:26,346
♪Having walked through prosperous times♪

213
00:17:26,464 --> 00:17:28,320
♪And travelled around the world♪

214
00:17:28,416 --> 00:17:31,504
♪Scars all over me♪

215
00:17:31,776 --> 00:17:34,688
♪If longing never fades♪

216
00:17:34,688 --> 00:17:36,137
♪Burns still hot♪

217
00:17:36,137 --> 00:17:39,216
♪Let it turn into dust and smoke♪

218
00:17:39,488 --> 00:17:41,345
♪After half a lifetime of loneliness♪

219
00:17:41,408 --> 00:17:42,592
♪In the next life♪

220
00:17:42,592 --> 00:17:47,072
♪Entangle with you again♪
